  <!-- EN: Fulfillment -->
  <Fulfillment_Fulfillment.label>《Fulfillment》</Fulfillment_Fulfillment.label>
  <!-- EN: Fulfillment is gained by performing work that the pawn is passionate about. It increases when engaging in tasks they have a passion for and is acquired during activities like crafting, researching, or fighting if they have a passion for those tasks. Keeping a pawn's fulfillment high can lead to better mood and productivity. -->
  <Fulfillment_Fulfillment.description>通过从事角色热衷的工作可以获得“满足感”。当角色从事自己热衷的任务时，满足感会增加；如果角色对制作、研究或战斗等活动充满热情，在进行这些活动时也会获得满足感。保持角色较高的满足感，可以提升其心情和工作效率。</Fulfillment_Fulfillment.description>
